      "source": "Create a new instance that applies the given <a href=\"../request/RequestPostProcessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.web.servlet.request\"><code>RequestPostProcessor</code></a>s\nto performed requests.",
      "translation": "创建一个新实例，将给定的<code>RequestPostProcessor</code><a href=\"../request/RequestPostProcessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.web.servlet.request\">接口</a>应用于执行的请求。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Connect to the origin server using the given <code>HttpMethod</code> and\n<code>URI</code> and apply the given <code>requestCallback</code> when the HTTP\nrequest of the underlying API can be initialized and written to.",
      "translation": "使用给定的 `<code>HttpMethod</code>` 和 `<code>URI</code>` 连接到源服务器，并在底层 API 的 HTTP 请求可以初始化并写入时应用给定的 `<code>requestCallback</code>`。",
